---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | ShouldISpend"
  description="Read the ShouldISpend privacy policy, including information about cookies, analytics, anonymous usage data, and future advertising."
>
  <style>
    .container {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 80px 24px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 4rem;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      margin: 44px 0 14px;
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    p,
    li {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #334155;
    }

    p {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    ul {
      padding-left: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .updated {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <main class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</div>

    <h1>Your Privacy Matters.</h1>

    <p class="updated">Last updated: May 20, 2026</p>

    <p>
      ShouldISpend respects your privacy. This policy explains what information
      may be collected when you use this website and how that information may be
      used to improve the site.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Do Not Collect</h2>

    <p>
      ShouldISpend does not require user accounts, logins, passwords, or personal
      profiles. The calculators on this website are designed for general planning
      and educational purposes.
    </p>

    <p>
      ShouldISpend does not intentionally collect sensitive personal financial
      information, and calculator entries are not stored in a user account or
      personal database.
    </p>

    <h2>Anonymous Usage Data</h2>

    <p>
      ShouldISpend may collect anonymous or aggregated usage data to understand
      how visitors use the website. This may include information such as pages
      visited, device type, browser type, general traffic sources, approximate
      geographic region, and time spent on pages.
    </p>

    <p>
      This information helps improve calculator quality, page performance,
      navigation, content usefulness, and overall user experience.
    </p>

    <h2>Google Analytics</h2>

    <p>
      ShouldISpend may use Google Analytics, including GA4, to measure website
      traffic and understand how visitors interact with the site. Google
      Analytics may use cookies or similar technologies to collect anonymous
      usage information.
    </p>

    <p>
      You can learn more about how Google uses information from sites and apps
      that use Google services by visiting Google’s privacy and terms resources.
      You may also use browser settings, privacy tools, or Google’s available
      opt-out tools to limit analytics tracking.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>

    <p>
      Cookies are small files stored on your device that help websites remember
      preferences, measure traffic, and improve functionality. ShouldISpend may
      use cookies directly or through third-party services.
    </p>

    <p>
      You can disable or limit cookies through your browser settings. Some
      website features may not function as intended if cookies are disabled.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising and Third-Party Services</h2>

    <p>
      ShouldISpend may use Google AdSense or other third-party advertising
      services in the future. These services may use cookies, advertising
      identifiers, or similar technologies to serve ads, measure ad performance,
      prevent fraud, and improve relevance.
    </p>

    <p>
      Third-party vendors, including Google, may use cookies to serve ads based
      on a visitor’s prior visits to this website or other websites. Visitors can
      manage ad personalization through their Google ad settings and browser
      privacy controls.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>

    <p>
      ShouldISpend may include affiliate links in the future. If you click an
      affiliate link and make a purchase or take another qualifying action, the
      site may earn a commission at no additional cost to you.
    </p>

    <h2>External Links</h2>

    <p>
      ShouldISpend may link to other websites. We are not responsible for the
      privacy practices, content, or policies of external websites.
    </p>

    <h2>Your Choices</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>You can disable cookies in your browser settings.</li>
      <li>You can use browser privacy tools or extensions to limit tracking.</li>
      <li>You can manage Google ad personalization through Google’s ad settings.</li>
      <li>You can choose not to use calculators that ask for estimates you prefer not to enter.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Policy Updates</h2>

    <p>
      This privacy policy may be updated as ShouldISpend grows, adds new
      features, introduces advertising, or uses additional third-party services.
      The “Last updated” date will reflect the most recent changes.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>

    <p>
      Questions about this privacy policy can be directed through the contact
      information provided on ShouldISpend.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>